 f enchanted creatures\, endearing allies\, and formidable adversaries—wh
 ere an entire hidden realm hangs in the balance. In an era of automation\,
  LAIKA delivers its most ambitious and globally accessible film yet—a bo
 ld fusion of human-crafted artistry and cinematic storytelling from the ma
 kers of Coraline.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO0000178
