 rill-ride in the 1980s sword-and-sorcery sweepstakes. It's also the only o
 ne that was photographed by John Alcott\, the Oscar-winning\, Kubrick favo
 rite DP who filmed THE SHINING and A CLOCKWORK ORANGE.\nhttps://amherstcin
 ema.org/films-and-events/beastmaster\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://p
