DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:15pm\, 7pm\, 9:30pm\nThe deeply emotional and inspirat
 ional true story of Ian Charleson\, a gifted actor whose greatest challeng
 e becomes his greatest triumph. Facing his own mortality with unflinching 
